      "writtenOn": "2026-08-28T08:22:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is needed for Honor\u0027s customized asynchronous Binder priority policy.\n\nWhen an asynchronous Binder transaction completes, we need to invoke trace_android_vh_binder_restore_priority() to restore the thread\u0027s original priority. This prevents a priority override from leaking into subsequent work.\n\nRegarding the symbol list, trace_android_vh_binder_restore_priority is already an existing symbol and is already included in the current symbol list. Therefore, this patch does not introduce any new symbols that need to be added.",
      "parentUuid": "905d9854_7a55edba",
      "revId": "1e3233bfdbd41af51ab6b515249128af9bc20052",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
