      "writtenOn": "2026-08-28T16:36:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Are you saying that the \"priority override\" is not being properly restored by the binder driver? If so, please submit an actual fix instead of a vendor hook. If not, then please clarify what this feature is doing and why the priority needs to be changed by the hook. Put this in the commit message.",
      "parentUuid": "d32b4c45_3dc6244c",
      "revId": "1e3233bfdbd41af51ab6b515249128af9bc20052",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
